  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 42 + 12 ÷ 24 × 84 - 14 = 91\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : + and ×​\n\nGiven statement : 42 + 12 ÷ 24 × 84 - 14 = 91\n\nAfter interchanging\n\n42 × **12 ÷ 24**__ + 84 - 14 = 91\n\n__**42 × **__**__0.5__** + 84 - 14 = 91\n\n__**21 + 84**__ - 14 = 91\n\n__**105 - 14**__ = 91\n\n91 = 91 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : ÷ and -\n\nGiven statement : 42 + 12 ÷ 24 × 84 - 14 = 91\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n42 + 12 - 24 × **84 ÷ 14**__ = 91\n\n42 + 12 - __**24 × 6**__ = 91\n\n__**42 + 12**__ - 144 = 91\n\n__**54 - 144**__ = 91\n\n-90 ≠ 91 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : - and +\n\nGiven statement : 42 + 12 ÷ 24 × 84 - 14 = 91\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n42 - **12 ÷ 24**__ × 84 + 14 = 91\n\n42 - __**0.5 × 84**__ + 14 = 91\n\n__**42 + 14**__ - 42 = 91\n\n__**56 - 42**__ = 91\n\n14 ≠ 91 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : × and ÷\n\nGiven statement : 42 + 12 ÷ 24 × 84 - 14 = 91\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n42 + 12 × **24 ÷ 84**__ - 14 = 91\n\n42 + __**12 **____**× 3.5**__ - 14 = 91\n\n__**42 + 42**__ - 14 = 91\n\n__**84 - 14**__ = 91\n\n70 ≠ 91 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
